# The primary flight display draws what HUD.cs draws.
#
# The facts name the elements the scene drew this frame; a vehicle on the link (SITL at
# tcp:127.0.0.1:5760) is what makes the readouts appear, since without one the display is a
# horizon at rest. `hud.missing` counts the doPaint() elements not yet ported, so a port that
# regresses one fails here and a port that adds one has to update the count.

screen fly
window 1600x1200
settle 6

expect hud.drawn ~ sky-ground
expect hud.drawn ~ pitch-ladder
expect hud.drawn ~ heading-tape
expect hud.drawn ~ xtrack-bar
expect hud.drawn ~ rate-of-turn
expect hud.drawn ~ speed-tape
expect hud.drawn ~ altitude-tape
expect hud.drawn ~ vsi
expect hud.drawn ~ mode-and-waypoint
expect hud.drawn ~ battery
expect hud.drawn ~ gps
expect hud.drawn ~ armed-banner
expect hud.missing 6
